        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8050E, Egg Knobset with Regular Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Egg Knob with Regular Rosette is an excellent choice for anyone with more traditional tastes. It is available in oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, and polished brass finishes just to name a few. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The Egg Knobset with Regular Round Rose's familiar shape creates something truly beautiful.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/keyed-egg-knob-with-regular-rose-emtek-5100e\"><b>Keyed Egg Knob with Regular Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Egg Shaped Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Egg Knob and Round Regular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stem: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Egg Knob with Regular Rosette",
                "description": "The Egg Knob with Regular Rosette is an excellent choice for anyone with more traditional tastes. It is available in oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, and polished brass finishes just to name a few. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The Egg Knobset with Regular Round Rose's familiar shape creates something truly beautiful.\r\n",
